{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/6b51bd5f945afa2e940e5cb12d55ca97.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hack Entodrive into your crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Battle Entodrive in turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Help the people of Cache Isle with Entodrive related incidents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Thwart the Forever Corporation's raid of the Isle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Face Mystical &amp; mysterious Void Entodrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Face your dev partner Max Jai in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Instant Action! (face randomized NPC battles with 5 tiers; lv 20, lv 30, lv 40, lv 50, lv 60)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Upgrade your monsters with ability stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Trade / Bartering with NPCs to gain different items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mine for items with your pickaxe in the post game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.poster.avif?t=1747154985\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.webm?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520710/extras/a6ae21dc38d5a8d27f7a5e57ea5d5ef0.mp4?t=1747154985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plot : </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the developer's for Entodrive AR. An augmented reality game that was made to gamify an outbreak of computer viruses. Your partner in development Max Jai was the face of business, but never got his hands dirty to develop the game. He calls upon your help when realizing Entodrive aren't behaving how they were programed. Entodrive begin attacking and possessing objects in the real world. The Entodrive have become something more than you intended. It is up to you and Max Jai to go on a quest to rediscover what Entodrive means to the people of Cache Isle and save them from Entodrive related incidents. This game takes place in the Apastron universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventure Awaits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/f415662b5e6b20fbdd6ee9249e9e734a50fbe30a.jpg"},{"name":"Just Visiting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/8ffec144ad3938c74a16203eafc32f0c40531a13.jpg"},{"name":"Multiversal Invaders","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/3548f9daa2db20a8279485d150393ac542096c89.jpg"},{"name":"Hello World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/732033d0d1b3bd6e285254e742eb1126e7a87393.jpg"},{"name":"Port of Dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/85b374968b01b4e215c9d73b2dabcdfc3bf72ed3.jpg"},{"name":"Champion's Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1520710/b95214e24ce16b033896082bbd392435e